{"id":"2112b0932fb2c41d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-equivalence.md","title":"Modal Equivalence","display":"df-modal-equivalence — Modal Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-equivalence","aliases":["89-df-modal-equivalence"],"display":"df-modal-equivalence — Modal Equivalence","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-equivalence — Modal Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n(A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n((A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n(A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n((A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>模态等价在 GL 中定义</li>\n<li>模态等价公式的双向蕴含属于 GL</li>\n<li>模态等价是 GL 的核心概念</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-logic]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-formula]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n(A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n((A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true}],"bytes":772,"backlinks":[{"id":"d5d0908b482e31f2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","0006800fa1c85177","32c9990061b9749d"]}